<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">Certain information marked as &ldquo;XXXX&rdquo;
has been excluded from the Share Subscription Agreement because it is both not material and is the type that the registrant treats as
private or confidential.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><B>&#32929;&#20221;&#35748;&#36141;&#21512;&#21516;</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><B>Share Subscription Agreement</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&#26412;&#32929;&#20221;&#35748;&#36141;&#21512;&#21516;&#65288;&ldquo;<B>&#26412;&#21512;&#21516;</B>&rdquo;&#65289;&#30001;&#20197;&#19979;&#21452;&#26041;&#20110;</FONT>2023<FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&#24180;</FONT>5<FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&#26376;</FONT>19<FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&#26085;&#65288;&ldquo;<B>&#31614;&#32626;&#26085;</B>&rdquo;&#65289;&#22312;&#20013;&#21326;&#20154;&#27665;&#20849;&#21644;&#22269;&#65288;&#20026;&#26412;&#21512;&#21516;&#20043;&#30446;&#30340;&#65292;&#19981;&#21253;&#25324;&#39321;&#28207;&#29305;&#21035;&#34892;&#25919;&#21306;&#12289;&#28595;&#38376;&#29305;&#21035;&#34892;&#25919;&#21306;&#21450;&#21488;&#28286;&#22320;&#21306;&#65292;&ldquo;<B>&#20013;&#22269;</B>&rdquo;&#65289;&#31614;&#32626;&#65306;</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">This Share Subscription Agreement (this &ldquo;<B>Agreement</B>&rdquo;)
is entered into as of May 19, 2023 (the &ldquo;<B>Signing Date</B>&rdquo;) in People&rsquo;s Republic of China (for the purpose of this
Agreement, excluding Hong Kong, Macao and Taiwan, the &ldquo;<B>PRC</B>&rdquo;) by and between:</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"><TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
<TD STYLE="width: 0"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 21pt">(1)</TD><TD STYLE="text-align: justify">SunCar Technology Group Inc.<FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&#65292;&#19968;&#23478;&#20381;&#25454;&#24320;&#26364;&#32676;&#23707;&#27861;&#24459;&#26377;&#25928;&#25104;&#31435;&#24182;&#21512;&#27861;&#23384;&#32493;&#24182;&#19988;&#22312;&#32654;&#22269;&#32435;&#26031;&#36798;&#20811;&#19978;&#24066;&#30340;&#20844;&#21496;&#65292;&#20844;&#21496;&#20195;&#30721;&#20026;</FONT>SDA<FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&#65292;&#20844;&#21496;&#22320;&#22336;&#20026;&#19978;&#28023;&#24066;&#38745;&#23433;&#21306;&#28789;&#30707;&#36335;</FONT>656<FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&#21495;</FONT>209<FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&#23460;&#65288;&ldquo;</FONT>SunCar<FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&rdquo;&#25110;&ldquo;<B>&#20844;&#21496;</B>&rdquo;&#65289;&#65307;&#21644;</FONT></TD></TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 21pt; text-align: justify">SunCar Technology Group Inc., a Cayman
Islands exempted company&nbsp;and listed on the Nasdaq Capital Market (&ldquo;NASDAQ&rdquo;) in the United States, with the company ticker
symbol &ldquo;SDA&rdquo; and with the address of Suite 209, No. 656 Lingshi Road, Jing&rsquo;an District, Shanghai, 200072, People&rsquo;s
Republic of China (&ldquo;<B>SunCar</B>&rdquo; or the &ldquo;<B>Company</B>&rdquo;); and</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"><TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
<TD STYLE="width: 0"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 21pt">(2)</TD><TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&#23433;&#21513;&#27901;&#28070;&#31169;&#21215;&#32929;&#26435;&#25237;&#36164;&#22522;&#37329;&#21512;&#20249;&#20225;&#19994;&#65288;&#26377;&#38480;&#21512;&#20249;&#65289;&#65292;&#19968;&#23478;&#20381;&#25454;&#20013;&#22269;&#27861;&#24459;&#35774;&#31435;&#24182;&#26377;&#25928;&#23384;&#32493;&#30340;&#21512;&#20249;&#20225;&#19994;&#65292;&#20854;&#20027;&#35201;&#32463;&#33829;&#22330;&#25152;&#20026;</FONT>XXXX<FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&#65288;&ldquo;&#23433;&#21513;&#27901;&#28070;&rdquo;&#25110;&ldquo;<B>&#35748;&#36141;&#20154;</B>&rdquo;&#65289;&#12290;</FONT></TD></TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 21pt; text-align: justify">Anji Zerun Private Equity Investment
Partnership (Limited Partnership), a Limited Partnership established and incorporated under the laws of China, has its principal place
of business at XXXX (&ldquo;<B>Anji</B>&rdquo; or the &ldquo;<B>Subscriber</B>&rdquo;).</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#20844;&#21496;&#21644;&#35748;&#36141;&#20154;&#21333;&#29420;&#31216;&#20026;&ldquo;<B>&#19968;&#26041;</B>&rdquo;&#65292;&#21512;&#31216;&#20026;&ldquo;<B>&#21452;&#26041;</B>&rdquo;&#12290;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">Each of the Company and the Subscriber shall be
hereinafter referred to as a &ldquo;<B>Party</B>&rdquo; respectively, and as the &ldquo;<B>Parties</B>&rdquo; collectively.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.5in; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#37492;&#20110;&#65306;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">Whereas:</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&#35748;&#36141;&#20154;&#25311;&#25353;&#29031;&#26412;&#21512;&#21516;&#35268;&#23450;&#30340;&#26465;&#27454;&#12289;&#26465;&#20214;&#21644;&#20215;&#26684;&#21521;&#20844;&#21496;&#35748;&#36141;&#19968;&#23450;&#25968;&#37327;&#30340;&#26222;&#36890;&#32929;&#65288;&#38480;&#21806;&#26399;&#65306;</FONT>6<FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&#20010;&#26376;&#65289;&#65292;&#19988;&#20844;&#21496;&#25311;&#25353;&#29031;&#26412;&#21512;&#21516;&#35268;&#23450;&#30340;&#26465;&#27454;&#12289;&#26465;&#20214;&#21644;&#20215;&#26684;&#21521;&#35748;&#36141;&#20154;&#25110;&#20854;&#25351;&#23450;&#30340;&#20851;&#32852;&#26041;&#26032;&#21457;&#34892;&#35813;&#31561;&#25968;&#37327;&#30340;&#31080;&#38754;&#20215;&#20540;&#20026;</FONT>0.0001<FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&#32654;&#20803;&#27599;&#32929;&#30340;&#26222;&#36890;&#32929;</FONT>A<FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&#32929;&#65288;&ldquo;<B>&#35748;&#36141;&#32929;&#31080;</B>&rdquo;&#65289;&#12290;</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">The Subscriber intends to subscribe for and purchase
certain Ordinary Shares (Lock-up Period: 6 months) of the Company and the Company intends to issue and sell to the Subscriber such amount
of the Company&rsquo;s Class A Ordinary Shares par value US$0.0001 per share of the Company (the &ldquo;<B>Purchased Shares</B>&rdquo;).</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#35748;&#36141;&#20154;&#39640;&#24230;&#35748;&#21487;&#20844;&#21496;&#30340;&#21457;&#23637;&#28508;&#21147;&#21644;&#21457;&#23637;&#21069;&#26223;&#65292;&#24076;&#26395;&#20316;&#20026;&#25112;&#30053;&#25237;&#36164;&#32773;&#65292;&#21442;&#19982;&#20844;&#21496;&#30340;&#21457;&#23637;&#12290;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">The Subscriber highly recognizes the Company&rsquo;s
development potential and prospects and hopes to participate in the Company&rsquo;s development as a strategic investor.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">The Parties are executing and delivering
this Agreement in reliance upon the exemption from securities registration afforded by the rules and regulations as promulgated by
the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission (the &ldquo;<B>SEC</B>&rdquo;) under Regulation S of the Securities Act of 1933
(&ldquo;<B>Regulation S</B>&rdquo;).</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"></P>

