<TD>&nbsp;</TD><TD>&nbsp;</TD><TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify">All approvals, permits, consents, registration,
filings or other formalities by or with any shareholders, board of directors of the Company, the stock exchanges, governmental authorities
and any third party which are required to be obtained by the Company in connection with the execution of this Agreement shall have been
obtained, accomplished and remain valid, except for those that cannot be properly obtained due to current laws, regulations and relevant
governmental authorities;</P>
</TD></TR>
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              </TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 35.45pt; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

