<TD>&nbsp;</TD><TD>&nbsp;</TD><TD STYLE="text-align: justify">This Agreement shall constitute valid
and legally binding obligations of the Company upon execution;</TD></TR>
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             </TABLE>

<P STYLE="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"></P>

