<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 28.3pt; text-align: justify">This Agreement shall be executed in
four (4) counterparts, and each party shall keep two (2) copies respectively, with the same legal effect.</P>

